leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the adult idle: waits for INFTABLE_GORON_CITY_DOORS_UNLOCKED, then starts the upward slide or, for the sideways door, the sliding-aside move with its one-point cutscene.
